{"seq":1,"slug":"where-ai-changes-the-lifecycle","title":"AI 在生命周期里改变了什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/rethinking-the-sdlc-with-ai/where-ai-changes-the-lifecycle","wordCount":1944,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-在生命周期里改变了什么\">AI 在生命周期里改变了什么</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>研发生命周期（SDLC）的每个环节都在被 AI 改变，但改变<strong>极不均匀</strong>：生成类环节被大幅压缩，评审、对齐、验证这些判断类环节的工作量反而在上升。这不是直觉推断。Google CEO 在 2024 年第三季度财报电话会上给过一手数据：「今天 Google 超过四分之一的新代码由 AI 生成，然后由工程师评审并接受」（<a href=\"https://blog.google/inside-google/message-ceo/alphabet-earnings-q3-2024/\">Alphabet Q3 2024 CEO remarks</a>）——生成已经快了，但「评审并接受」这道闸门原样留在流程里。如果只盯着「写代码变快」而不调整下游，结果就是 DORA 测到的那种错位：AI 采用率每提高 25%，软件交付吞吐约降 1.5%，交付稳定性约降 7.2%（<a href=\"https://dora.dev/research/2024/dora-report/\">DORA 2024 报告</a>，Figure 10）。看清瓶颈移到了哪里，是重设流程的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>不均匀加速</strong>：AI 对生命周期各环节的加速幅度差异极大——生成类被大幅压缩，判断、验证、整合类反而吃紧。</li>\n<li><strong>瓶颈转移</strong>：流程吞吐由最慢的一环决定；生成变快之后，瓶颈从「写得慢」移到「消化不了」，即评审、验证与整合。</li>\n<li><strong>AI 是放大器</strong>：它放大组织既有的强实践与弱实践，本身不单独创造交付能力。</li>\n<li><strong>近似正确</strong>：AI 产出的典型失败模式是「看起来几乎对、其实不对」，抽查式评审对它失效，需要专门的验收断言接住。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：生成端的加速已被反复证实，吞吐能否兑现取决于最慢的一环是否跟着变快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不均匀的加速\">不均匀的加速</h2><p>同一时期两组对照实验，把「加速」在不同环节的差距摆上了桌面。在<strong>全新、隔离的小任务</strong>上，GitHub Copilot 的对照实验中实验组完成 HTTP server 实现比对照组快 55.8%（arXiv:2302.06590）；而在<strong>成熟的大型开源项目</strong>上，METR 的随机对照试验发现：16 名资深开发者在各自平均有 5 年经验的活跃项目中完成 246 个真实任务，允许使用早期 2025 款 AI 工具（主要是 Cursor Pro 与 Claude 3.5/3.7 Sonnet）反而<strong>慢了 19%</strong>——尽管开发者事前预测会快 24%，事后仍自我估计快了 20%（arXiv:2507.09089）。两个数字并不矛盾，它们测的是生命周期的不同位置：对从零生成，AI 的加速是真实的；对需要深层项目上下文的存量演进，则远不成立。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节类型</th>\n<th>代表活动</th>\n<th>AI 影响</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生成类</td>\n<td>写代码、写测试、起草文档</td>\n<td>大幅加速（新代码场景最显著）</td>\n<td>产出量上升，耗时大头被压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判断类</td>\n<td>评审、架构决策、意图对齐</td>\n<td>加速有限</td>\n<td>工作量随生成量水涨船高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证类</td>\n<td>测试、QA、CI</td>\n<td>部分加速但有对抗性</td>\n<td>要应对「看起来对其实不对」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整合类</td>\n<td>多人/多 agent 合并与协调</td>\n<td>几乎未加速</td>\n<td>成为新的成本中心</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>使用者侧的数据同样指向消化端：Stack Overflow 2025 开发者调查中，66% 的开发者称最大挫败感是「AI 方案看起来几乎对、其实不对」，45% 表示调试 AI 生成的代码更费时间（<a href=\"https://survey.stackoverflow.co/2025/ai\">SO 2025 Survey</a>）。生成端每省下一分钟，验证端可能要多花不止一分钟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瓶颈转移到哪里\">瓶颈转移到哪里</h2><p>用排队视角看更清楚。设某条流水线生成耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、评审耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，生成端提速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 倍后，端到端时间为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi>s</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\;=\\; \\frac{T_g}{s} + T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>整体加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{T_g + T_r}{T_g/s + T_r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相对占比升高而迅速衰减。这正是 DORA 2025 年报告观察到的机制：AI 成功加速了初始代码生成，「省下的创作时间经常被重新分配到审计与验证」（<a href=\"https://dora.dev/insights/balancing-ai-tensions/\">Balancing AI tensions, dora.dev</a>）；该报告对 1110 份工程师开放问卷的主题分析显示，AI 最集中的四个触点恰好横跨两端——代码生成、信息检索、代码评审、测试。</p>\n<p>落到具体环节，新瓶颈集中在四处：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>评审成为决定吞吐的关口</strong>：Octoverse 2025 统计全年合并 PR 达 5.187 亿条、同比增 29%（<a href=\"https://github.blog/news-insights/octoverse/octoverse-a-new-developer-joins-github-every-second-as-ai-leads-typescript-to-1/\">Octoverse 2025</a>），其中大量有 AI 参与——评审产能跟不上时，堆积的不只是代码，还有每次切换所需的上下文重建成本。这一环的机制设计与缓解手段见<a href=\"../ai-across-the-lifecycle/implementation-and-review-with-ai\">实现与评审阶段</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>意图定义前移变重</strong>：spec-driven development 的兴起是对这一瓶颈的直接回应。GitHub Spec Kit 的自我定位就是「先定义要建什么，再动手建」，主张规格成为直接驱动实现的主工件（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/spec-kit\">github/spec-kit</a>）；AWS Kiro 同样把每个特性规格固化为 <code>requirements.md</code> / <code>design.md</code> / <code>tasks.md</code> 三件套与三阶段工作流（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Kiro Specs 文档</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>验证体系吃紧</strong>：测试与 CI 要同时消化人类代码和 AI 代码，后者特有的失败模式是置信度不低的「近似正确」，抽查式评审对其失效。测试与交付侧的具体对策见<a href=\"../ai-across-the-lifecycle/testing-and-delivery-with-ai\">测试与交付阶段</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>整合与编排成为新工作量</strong>：多 agent 并行产出的合并、冲突消解与一致性维护，本身构成了此前不存在的环节。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[规划与规格] --&gt;|前移变重| B[生成&lt;br/&gt;大幅加速]&#10;    B --&gt; C[评审&lt;br/&gt;新瓶颈]&#10;    B --&gt; D[测试与 CI&lt;br/&gt;负荷上升]&#10;    C --&gt; E[整合与编排&lt;br/&gt;新增工作量]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[交付]&#10;    C -. 积压反馈 .-&gt; B\">flowchart LR\n    A[规划与规格] --&gt;|前移变重| B[生成&lt;br/&gt;大幅加速]\n    B --&gt; C[评审&lt;br/&gt;新瓶颈]\n    B --&gt; D[测试与 CI&lt;br/&gt;负荷上升]\n    C --&gt; E[整合与编排&lt;br/&gt;新增工作量]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[交付]\n    C -. 积压反馈 .-&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"对流程设计的含义\">对流程设计的含义</h2><p>认清瓶颈转移之后，流程设计有三条推论。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>优化对象必须跟着瓶颈走</strong>。继续给「写代码」叠加工具，边际回报已趋近于零；投入应转向评审产能（如机器辅助预审）、规格质量与验证基建。DORA 2025 年报告的总结论是把 AI 视作「放大器」：它放大组织的既有优势，也放大既有失能——拥有高质量内部平台与强测试实践的团队如虎添翼，工具链碎片化的团队只是更快地生产技术债（<a href=\"https://dora.dev/research/2025/dora-report/\">DORA 2025 报告</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>平衡生成与消化的产能</strong>。用 Little&#39;s Law 表述：稳定系统中在制品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>——到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 被 AI 抬高后，若服务率（消化能力）不变，等待时间或积压必然恶化。生成产能远超消化产能的团队，速度并没有变快，只是库存变多了。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>把投资前移到便宜的部分</strong>。规格阶段的返工成本远低于已合入代码的返工成本；在意图定义上多花一小时，等于为下游所有生成购买了方向正确性。这是「成本花在前面更便宜」的排队论版本：减少到达的废流量，比扩容消化端更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><p>落地优先做三件可度量的事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>给评审队列装仪表盘</strong>：跟踪 PR 等待评审时长、评审延迟分布、AI 参与 PR 与纯人工 PR 的返工率差值。没有这几个数，就无法判断瓶颈是否真的在消化端，流程调整只能靠猜。</li>\n<li><strong>按任务类型分流 AI 策略</strong>：绿地原型大胆交给 agent 并行探索；存量核心模块参考 METR 的结果保持保守——让 AI 做定位、解释与草拟，由人执笔修改。</li>\n<li><strong>把「近似正确」当默认假设设防</strong>：为 AI 产出单独增加验收断言（属性测试、契约测试、金样本比对），而非复用面向人工代码的抽查式评审。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>AI 把 SDLC 的短板从「写得慢」换成了「消化不了」。生成端的加速已被反复证实，吞吐是否兑现则取决于评审、验证与整合能否跟上。流程改进的正确姿势，是持续测量瓶颈位置并把投资移向最慢的一环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 在生命周期里改变了什么","id":"ai-在生命周期里改变了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不均匀的加速","id":"不均匀的加速"},{"level":2,"text":"瓶颈转移到哪里","id":"瓶颈转移到哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"对流程设计的含义","id":"对流程设计的含义"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"从个人工具到团队实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/rethinking-the-sdlc-with-ai/from-individual-tool-to-team-practice"}}